            " -------------- ------- ------------- -------------------------- ------------------------------------------------- ----------------------------------------- ",
            "  source         uuid    state         keys (names only)          value shapes                                      twig-referenced                          ",
            " -------------- ------- ------------- -------------------------- ------------------------------------------------- ----------------------------------------- ",
            "  OAuth Source   src-1   holds-value   client_id, client_secret   client_id: string | client_secret: string #ab12   no                                       ",
            "  ?              src-2   holds-value   token                                                                        YES -> headers.Authorization, query.key  ",
            " -------------- ------- ------------- -------------------------- ------------------------------------------------- ----------------------------------------- ",
            "",
            "Sources inspected : 3",
            "Hold a value      : 2",
            "Already clear     : 1",
            "Unreadable        : 0",
            "Twig-referenced   : 1",
            "",
            " [WARNING] Some sources reference `source.authenticationConfig` from a Twig template in their `configuration`.          ",
            "           CallService renders those templates against the RAW source, so those references DO resolve to live secrets   ",
            "           today. Removal will REFUSE these sources. Re-point them at `configuration.authentication` first.             ",
            "",
            "Next: review the keys above, then run with --remove-authentication-config to DELETE these values. authenticationConfig is vestigial (no code authenticates from it) — see ocon#232.",
            ""
        ],
        "calls": [
            [
                "auditAll",
                50
            ]
        ]
    },
